The '''2025–26 Süper Lig''', officially called the '''Trendyol Süper Lig Mehmet Ali Yılmaz season''', was the 68th season of the [[Süper Lig]], the highest tier [[Association football|football]] league of [[Turkey]]. It began on 8 August 2025. The first half of the season concluded on 22 December 2025, with the second half commencing on 16 January 2026. The season ended on 17 May 2026.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|web|title=Profesyonel Liglerde 2025–2026 Sezon Planlamaları Belirlendi – Ligler Haber Detay Sayfası TFF |url=https://www.tff.org/default.aspx?pageID=204&ftxtID=47720 |website=www.tff.org |publisher=Turkish Football Federation |access-date=20 June 2025 |language=tr |date=30 May 2025}}</ref>

Galatasaray were the three-time consecutive defending champions and retained their title with a 4–2 home win against [[Antalyaspor]] on 9 May 2026. The season is named after the former Trabzonspor president Mehmet Ali Yılmaz, who died in 2024.

== Teams ==
Eighteen teams competed in the league – the top fifteen teams from the [[2024–25 Süper Lig|previous season]] and the three teams promoted from the [[2024–25 TFF First League|First League]]. On 16 April 2025, the Turkish Football Federation decided to reduce the number of teams in the league to 18, starting from the upcoming season.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|web| title=TFF'den Radikal Karar: Süper Lig 18 Takıma Düşüyor! | url=https://www.hasretgazetesi.com.tr/tffden-radikal-karar-super-lig-18-takima-dusuyor }}</ref>

===Changes from last season===

==== Relegations ====
[[Adana Demirspor]], [[Sivasspor]], [[Bodrum FK]] and [[Hatayspor]] have been relegated to the [[2025–26 TFF First League]].

==== Promotions ====
[[Kocaelispor]], [[Gençlerbirliği S.K.|Gençlerbirliği]] and [[Fatih Karagümrük S.K.|Fatih Karagümrük]] have been promoted to Süper Lig after 16, 4 and 1 seasons of absence, respectively. After one season of absence the capital city of [[Ankara]] will be again represented in Süper Lig.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|title=Kocaelispor 16 yıl sonra Süper Lig'de |url=https://www.aa.com.tr/tr/futbol/kocaelispor-16-yil-sonra-super-ligde/3543275 |access-date=22 April 2025 |work=www.aa.com.tr |agency=Anadolu Agency |language=tr}}</ref><ref>{{#invoke:cite|web|title=Cumhuriyet ile yaşıt Gençlerbirliği, Süper Lig'e geri döndü |url=https://www.aa.com.tr/tr/futbol/cumhuriyet-ile-yasit-genclerbirligi-super-lige-geri-dondu/3563234 |website=www.aa.com.tr |publisher=Anadolu Agency |access-date=13 May 2025 |language=tr}}</ref>

